Why This Market Matters
X-ray metrology provides manufacturers with a non-destructive method for measuring internal structures, material composition, thin-film properties, defects, and other characteristics that can be difficult to evaluate using conventional surface-based techniques. Its importance is increasing as semiconductor structures become smaller and more complex and as aerospace, automotive, EV battery, and advanced-material applications demand precise internal inspection.

